---
layout: layouts/page.njk
title: Service Areas
lead: We serve homeowners across Greater Orlando — Orange, Seminole, Lake, and Osceola counties.
eyebrow: Where We Work
permalink: /service-areas/
---

<section class="section">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="map-embed">
      <iframe src="https://maps.google.com/maps?q=Orlando+FL&t=&z=10&ie=UTF8&iwloc=&output=embed" allowfullscreen loading="lazy" referrerpolicy="no-referrer-when-downgrade"></iframe>
    </div>
    <div class="county-grid">
      <div class="county-card">
        <strong>Orange County</strong>
        <p>Orlando, Winter Park, Maitland, Apopka, Windermere</p>
      </div>
      <div class="county-card">
        <strong>Seminole County</strong>
        <p>Oviedo, Lake Mary, Casselberry, Longwood, Altamonte Springs</p>
      </div>
      <div class="county-card">
        <strong>Lake County</strong>
        <p>Clermont, Leesburg, Tavares, Mount Dora</p>
      </div>
      <div class="county-card">
        <strong>Osceola County</strong>
        <p>Kissimmee, St. Cloud, Celebration, Poinciana</p>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="section-head" style="margin-bottom:24px;">
      <span class="eyebrow">Cities We Cover</span>
      <h2>Central Florida Service Area</h2>
      <p>Not sure if we come to you? Call — if we can get there, we will.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="area-grid">
      {% for city in areas.list %}
      <div class="area-chip">{{ city }}</div>
      {% endfor %}
    </div>
    <div style="max-width:600px;margin:40px auto 0;background:var(--charcoal);padding:36px;text-align:center;">
      <h3 style="color:#fff;margin-bottom:8px;">Don't see your city?</h3>
      <p style="color:rgba(255,255,255,0.65);margin-bottom:24px;">Give us a call — we'll let you know if we can make it out to you.</p>
      <a href="tel:{{ site.phoneHref }}" class="btn btn--amber btn--lg">Call {{ site.phone }}</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
